    {
      "type": "heading",
      "content": "Common irregular participles",
      "props": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "id": "65ffc472-04c8-4b66-bb59-cccfb66d804e"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Many common verbs have a participle that you learn as a complete form. The helper follows the patterns from lessons 25 and 26; the participle stays at the end.",
      "id": "bc3b6f05-de60-41ad-99a9-0fc1d5a88007"
    },
    {
      "type": "callout",
      "content": "Perfect: present-tense hebben or zijn + the participle at the end. Learn these irregular participles as whole forms: doen → gedaan; zien → gezien; eten → gegeten; drinken → gedronken; lezen → gelezen; schrijven → geschreven; hebben → gehad; zijn → geweest.",
      "props": {
        "variant": "grammar",
        "icon": "book-open"
      },
      "id": "8f597bb8-8a41-405d-8de5-3ce662dd33be"
    },
    {
      "type": "columnList",
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "column",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "props": {
                "level": 3
              },
              "content": "Common forms",
              "id": "4191153e-ff69-4e5f-b3ff-b2ff20441750"
            },
            {
              "type": "bulletListItem",
              "content": "doen → gedaan",
              "id": "6f5ea8a8-4d96-4cf3-98e3-c92d7529a0da"
            },
            {
              "type": "bulletListItem",
              "content": "zien → gezien",
              "id": "e0754f71-6a4a-42f9-a4ee-668b4f9fd912"
            },
            {
              "type": "bulletListItem",
              "content": "eten → gegeten",
              "id": "c1abe575-bb4c-4245-82db-b7cd48f981ff"
            },
            {
              "type": "bulletListItem",
              "content": "drinken → gedronken",
              "id": "6c93b03b-13db-4034-815f-a3a9dbfe95d7"
            }
          ],
          "id": "71bfc1e2-fcc8-4458-a9e5-259afa493ce8"
        },
        {
          "type": "column",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "props": {
                "level": 3
              },
              "content": "More forms",
              "id": "b5ef0dbb-cd35-46b2-b511-4a1e2ce5d04e"
            },
            {
              "type": "bulletListItem",
              "content": "lezen → gelezen",
              "id": "11113e35-0fe9-4853-b330-9775207b523d"
            },
            {
              "type": "bulletListItem",
              "content": "schrijven → geschreven",
              "id": "465aeb24-6f30-423d-890c-d665e9af5ad6"
            },
            {
              "type": "bulletListItem",
              "content": "hebben → gehad",
              "id": "9d922e97-af69-4176-bf50-ef474c299d8f"
            },
            {
              "type": "bulletListItem",
              "content": "zijn → geweest",
              "id": "818e776c-053a-4496-a9da-41e1ff60a5cd"
            }
          ],
          "id": "a50caa0c-eda2-4fd4-9987-127a762c956b"
        }
      ],
      "id": "eacf22a3-0bff-4d54-83c4-5783e55b23a6"
    },
    {
      "type": "example",
      "content": [
        "Ik heb de paella ",
