    {
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "content": "Learn each irregular participle together with its infinitive.",
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "bulletListItem",
          "content": "Say the infinitive, then the participle: zien → gezien.",
          "id": "34e3cc39-d14f-47f7-a2e8-785e806e5cf8"
        },
        {
          "type": "bulletListItem",
          "content": "Use the correct helper already learned: Sofia is in Valencia geweest.",
          "id": "0bd37034-2041-48c2-a737-19c5b2f98d3c"
        }
      ],
      "id": "aeec9313-68c4-4bf8-a13a-0b7fa7e18f74"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "content": "Examples in the story",
      "props": {
        "level": 3
      },
