        "Sofia heeft met kerst gekookt."
      ],
      "props": {
        "translation": "Sofia cooked at Christmas.",
        "note": "Recycles the regular participle from lesson 25."
      },
      "id": "f56618ad-aa0d-40ec-9703-6fe40cd8ce1d"
    },
